<title>USA: Snohomish Cty, Wash., deal ylds 5.85 pct in 2017. [CORRECTED 19:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>Snohomish Cty, Wash., deal ylds 5.85 pct in 2017. [CORRECTED 19:59 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc Tuesday said it tentatively priced $4.75 million Public Utility District No. 1 of Snohomish County, Wash., at a top yield of 5.85 percent in 2017.</p>
<p>PUBLIC UTILITY DISTRICT NO. 1</p>
<p>RE: $4,750,000*</p>
<p>OF SNOHOMISH COUNTY, WASHINGTON</p>
<p>WATER SYSTEM REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>										MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>	 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 2001 - 2013		2001 - 2013</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>EXCEPT:</p>
<p>	11/01/1998-11/01/2000   MOODY'S: A   S&amp;P: A+</p>
<p>		     11/01/2017   MOODY'S: A   S&amp;P: A+</p>
<p>(Corrects ratings on the 1998 - 2000 and the 2017 maturities.)</p>
<p> DATED: 11/15/1996     FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
